/T (Finding vehicles in Pakistan is frustrating and inefficient. Buyers have to browse PakWheels, OLX, Facebook groups, dealership sites, and WhatsApp forwards. Many listings are outdated, fake, already sold, or missing key details.  Most platforms assume English literacy. A large population searches in Urdu or Roman Urdu, which current systems do not understand properly.)
